  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TaleStoneData
  DialogueLines:
  - textVI: "T\u1EA1i sao ch\xFAng ta l\u1EA1i t\u1ED3n t\u1EA1i? Li\u1EC7u \u0111\xE2y
      c\xF3 ph\u1EA3i l\xFD do m\xE0 ch\xFAng ta mong mu\u1ED1n? Nh\u1EEFng \u0111\u1ED1m
      s\xE1ng \xF4 u\u1EBF n\xE0y l\xE0 g\xEC?"
    textEN: "Why do we exist? Is this truly the purpose we desired? And these...
      defiled sparks of light\u2014what are they?"
